    {
      "content": "## Planning pgbackrest (crontab.aciertech \u2014 UTC+0, Lom\u00e9)\n\n| T\u00e2che | Planification | N\u0153ud | Script |\n|-------|--------------|------|--------|\n| **Backup FULL** | Dimanche 02:00 UTC | pg-node-1 | `backup_full.sh` |\n| **Backup DIFF** | Lun\u2013Sam 02:00 UTC | pg-node-1 | `backup_diff.sh` |\n| **V\u00e9rification** | Quotidien 03:00 UTC | pg-node-1 | `verify_backup.sh` |\n| **Stanza check** | Mercredi 01:00 UTC | pg-node-1 | `pgbackrest check` |\n| **Test restauration** | *(activer sur restore-test-server)* | restore-test-server | `test_restore.sh` |\n| **Log cleanup** | 1er du mois 01:00 UTC | pg-node-1 | `logclean` |\n\n**Config :** backup-standby=y \u2192 backup depuis pg-node-2 / repo1=NFS /var/lib/pgbackrest / cipher=aes-256-cbc / retention-full=4",
      "gridPos": {
